PoIAna / briscola-rl
Upstream author: Ivan Ravasi; model training credits in the PoIAna UI also name Davide Zambelli.

Game source: https://github.com/ivanrava/poiana
Training source: https://github.com/ivanrava/briscola-rl
Publisher page: https://ivanrava.itch.io/poiana
Release date shown by publisher: 2024-05-12

The publisher page declares:
- Code license: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL)
- Asset license: Creative Commons Attribution v4.0 International

The repository ZIP snapshots used for this BriscoLab integration did not contain
a standalone root LICENSE file. Original ONNX binaries are therefore retained
with this provenance notice and the publisher's project-level license
statements. BriscoLab project code does not replace the upstream terms.

BriscoLab v1.3.0 bundles 23 original ONNX model files unmodified and includes
separate derived *-policy.bin tensor bundles for deterministic Arena execution.
Those derived bundles contain only float tensors extracted from the respective
ONNX graphs and remain attributed to the upstream PoIAna models.
